    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_audio_decoder" kindref="compound">AudioDecoder</ref> class provides an abstraction over the decoding of common audio formats. Create will instantiate a proper audio decoder and calling Decode will fill a buffer with audio data which must be passed to the audio hardware. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
